OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'does not accept'
OL,4,Athere is no more money for Stormont
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fsaid she does not accept the
OL,8,Fgovernment's assertion that there is no
OL,9,Fmore money on offer to Stormont, amid
OL,10,Fan ongoing stalemate over the budget.
OL,12,FEarlier on Wednesday, the Secretary of
OL,13,FState Sir Chris Bryant accused
OL,14,Fexecutive ministers of being
OL,15,Ffinancially "irresponsible".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
