OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'does not accept'
OL,4,Athere is no more money for Stormont
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe executive has not agreed a budget
OL,7,Ffor this year, blaming the UK's
OL,8,Fdevolution funding formula for leaving
OL,9,Fit short. Additional funding of about
OL,10,F#1.5bn would be released in three
OL,11,Ftranches, with #525m available this
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FDeputy First Minister Emma
OL,15,FLittle-Pengelly said it was a time "for
OL,16,Fcalm heads and getting around the table
OL,17,Fto see if we can find a resolution".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
